OL,5,G2000 The Box
OL,6,     FGary Lineker continues to put the
OL,7,     Fcelebrities through their paces as
OL,8,     Fthe competition intensifies. With
OL,9,     Fthe boxes opening in ever more
OL,10,     Fweird and wonderful locations, the
OL,11,     Ffear of the unknown shows no sign
OL,12,     Fof easing - but there's a shift in
OL,13,     Fmood as the camaraderie fades,
OL,14,     Freplaced by growing mistrust. As
OL,15,     Ftensions rise, two more
OL,16,     Fcelebrities go head to head in a
OL,17,     Fdemanding duel - where only one
OL,18,     Fcan prevail and the other is sent
OL,19,     Fback in their box
